		{
			"id":"3483ce444c755a8c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Prism Pristine, Three Colors to Count\n\nMaybe I need a Secret Passage to the West Spring on the first three rows of the house and then use a Prism Key?\n\nI can't draft the Secret Passage on the West Wing, the any other way I can do it to the West towards the water is if I place it inside the Outer Room.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":400,
			"y":340,
			"width":540,
			"height":520
		},
		{"id":"0a2ec43a888382d3","type":"file","file":"99. attachments/BLUE_PRINCE_zdVtCM0nm5.png","x":-380,"y":1020,"width":1240,"height":698},
